      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Alignment with the bond wire has no correlation to anything with setup. Landing locations are just chosen more or less arbitrarily. When the landing locations are linear it seemed like it was easier for them to edit when problems came up, as they could sortof bulk edit. When all the landings were along some arc there was nothing to reference as they're all independent. \nI hope I'm explaining that right",
